tll-http (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * curl: Do not use anonymous namespace in the header
  * libuwsc:
    Build with new ssl dependency
    Set SNI SSL extension
    Faster nonce generation
  * tests: Fix duplicate channel names
  * tll-ev: Map libev to tll channel objects
  * uws:
    Add DELETE and PATCH methods
    Add sndbuf/rcvbuf settings for testing
    Report write full/ready status
    Fill Connect message for websockets and HTTP
    Per channel list of extra HTTP headers
    Support POST_MORE flag for HTTP sessions
  * uwsc:
    Load default CA when compiled with openssl
    Fix incorrect log level filtering
    Fix timerfd leak
    Pass URL suffix in open
    Use tll libev emulation

 -- Pavel Shramov <shramov@mexmat.net>  Thu, 07 May 2026 09:39:14 +0300

